  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/07/P1110291.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">El Suera Obert Museu (SOM) ha tornat a obrir les seues portes im&agrave;ginaries, per primera vegada al 2015, amb la trilla, que s&#39;ha complementat amb la mostra de Comerciants de Sueras. Diumenge 2 d&#39;agost, dins del actes que organitza tamb&eacute; el Centre Cultural Suera, el SOM es dedicar&agrave; als jocs tradicionals.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/somestiu15trilla/p1110212.jpg\" alt=\"p1110212\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/somestiu15trilla/p1110213.jpg\" alt=\"p1110213\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/somestiu15trilla/p1110215.jpg\" alt=\"p1110215\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/somestiu15trilla/p1110217.jpg\" alt=\"p1110217\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/somestiu15trilla/p1110218.jpg\" alt=\"p1110218\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/somestiu15trilla/p1110219.jpg\" alt=\"p1110219\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/somestiu15trilla/p1110220.jpg\" alt=\"p1110220\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/somestiu15trilla/p1110221.jpg\" alt=\"p1110221\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/somestiu15trilla/p1110222.jpg\" alt=\"p1110222\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img s